<task id="049" project="ebilling-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>InvoiceSubmissionProcessing job</title>
    <phase>2 Submission and extraction (WP2)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>The only creator of sprk_invoice (ADR-002), all-or-nothing persistence across several tables, idempotent re-delivery, and the point where AI output turns into accept / reject decisions.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Composes eight component contracts (043, 045, 046, 047, 072, 073, 014, 016) into one transactional pipeline; integration mistakes create partial or duplicate invoices.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>014, 016, 043, 044, 046, 047, 072, 073</deps>
    <tags>bff, jobs, ai, write-path</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-3 days</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Implement the ADR-004 IJobHandler for JobType InvoiceSubmissionProcessing (defined by 044) that runs Processing Pipeline steps 1-7 for one submission: read (043), resolve (046), code and observe (047), evaluate (072), decide (073), persist all-or-nothing, then enqueue indexing and the notification seam. Idempotent per submission id; every status transition persisted (FR-20, NFR-08).</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in ADR-004 job handlers, Dataverse transactional writes and the Finance and Signals services. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>A thin InvoiceSubmissionProcessingJobHandler delegating to an InvoiceSubmissionProcessor; Accepted creates invoice (In Review), lines, approval portion, Signals and the document's invoice link, recalculates totals through 016, enqueues indexing and calls the notification seam; Rejected writes outcome, reason code and findings JSON on the submission; Failed leaves no invoice; re-delivery never duplicates.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-20 (acceptance: idempotent per submission id; a failure after line creation leaves no invoice; status transitions persisted), Processing Pipeline steps 1-7, FR-21 (unreadable document → Failed or Rejected with stable reason code, never a partial invoice), NFR-08. Submission columns (020): sprk_processingstatus Received / Processing / Accepted / Rejected / Failed, sprk_outcomereasoncode, sprk_findingsjson, sprk_invoice, sprk_trackingnumber, sprk_firminvoicenumber. Existing handler shape to copy: Services/Jobs/Handlers/InvoiceExtractionJobHandler.cs (JobTypeName :50, ExtractInvoiceFactsAsync call :221, InvoiceIndexing enqueue :357). Transactions: Spaarke.Dataverse DataverseServiceClientImpl.cs:2696 BulkUpdateAsync and :2737 BuildBulkUpdateTransaction cover single-table updates only; there is no multi-table create helper. Signals go through SignalWriter (Services/Signals/SignalWriter.cs) using 072's BillingFindingSignalMapper. Approver resolution is task 103's; notifications are 132's.</background>
