    <output type="test">InvoiceSubmissionProcessorTests.cs, InvoiceSubmissionProcessingJobHandlerTests.cs</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Accepted path: exactly one sprk_invoice (In Review), its lines with extraction-confidence JSON and codes, one approval portion, the document's invoice link, totals from 016, Signals for every finding, submission Accepted with sprk_invoice set; indexing enqueued; notification sink called once.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rejected path: submission Rejected with reason code and findings JSON; no sprk_invoice, line or approval row exists.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative (FR-20): a fault injected after line creation leaves no invoice, lines or approval row; the submission is Failed or left for retry, never Accepted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative (NFR-08): re-delivery of a completed job creates nothing new; re-delivery after a Signal-write failure completes the Signals and creates no second invoice.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Each read reason code maps as specified (document-level → Rejected; service_failed → retry then Failed); Ebilling:Enabled false → Failed ebilling.disabled; Null AI facade → Failed ai.invoice.disabled.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Status transitions are persisted in order Received, Processing, then one terminal state; each is observable through 044's GET route.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No AI output alone produces Rejected: a test with a failing AiObservation finding and all-reliable reads yields Accepted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named above. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Publish-size delta of Sprk.Bff.Api measured against a fresh master build and recorded in task notes; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build exits 0; dotnet test exits 0.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Spec FR-20, FR-21, FR-26, NFR-08, Processing Pipeline. Shared append point: FinanceModule.cs. SPA and internal submissions skip attachment classification (FR-21). Eligible approvers and in-app notification are 103 / 132; the PDF report is 133; firm-visible projection of findings is 130 (this task stores the full findings JSON).</notes>

